<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', padding: '20px 60px', background: '#10141A', fontFamily: "'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Helvetica Neue',sans-serif", flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    {/* A · 标题块（100px） */}
    <Box style={{ height: 100, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, color: '#EDF1F5', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>
            一次实现，三种形态；从报告到仪表
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 6, letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>
            One engine, three forms — from a one-off report to an instrument
        </Text>
    </Box>

    {/* B · 内容区（540px） */}
    <Box style={{ height: 540 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, height: 348 }}>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 22, background: '#1D242E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #232C38' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1, color: '#E3A33E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>
                    01
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 10 }}>
                    三种形态，同一套引擎
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 4, letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>
                    One engine, three interfaces
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#A8B2BE', marginTop: 10 }}>
                    HTTP API、CLI 与 Web 界面共用同一套核心模块，不重复实现。CLI 可直接挂进 CI：风险分超过阈值就以退出码 2 阻断合并请求。加一个新能力，只需加一个端点文件。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #232C38' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4CB8A6' }}>
                        HTTP · CLI · Web 同源，可复用
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 22, background: '#1D242E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #232C38' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1, color: '#E3A33E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>
                    02
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 10 }}>
                    三个真实场景
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 4, letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>
                    Three real scenarios
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#A8B2BE', marginTop: 10 }}>
                    技术尽调与并购 —— 现有工具只看复杂度与测试覆盖率，没人看知识可继承性；团队交接 —— 直接产出「这几处必须补文档或找当事人」的清单；项目复盘 —— 把「当时为什么这么改」变成可查的证据链。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #232C38' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4CB8A6' }}>
                        尽调 · 交接 · 复盘
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 22, background: '#1D242E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #232C38', borderTop: '3px solid #E3A33E' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1, color: '#E3A33E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>
                    03
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 10 }}>
                    已知边界与下一步
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 4, letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>
                    Known limits and what comes next
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#A8B2BE', marginTop: 10 }}>
                    当前全部依赖 GitHub REST API，读不到私有仓库的完整历史，而尽调恰恰需要它 —— 卖方不会给你 Token。下一步改为本地 git log：零 API 成本、完整历史、不碰对方凭据。边界我们主动说，不等评委问。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #232C38' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4CB8A6' }}>
                        下一步：本地 git 分析
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        {/* 收束金句条 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 176, marginTop: 16, padding: '22px 26px', background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(227,163,62,0.14) 0%, rgba(76,184,166,0.10) 100%)', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid rgba(227,163,62,0.30)', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#EDF1F5', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>
                它不是一次性报告，是一台仪表 —— 三个月后再跑一次，看知识可追溯率有没有变好。
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 10 }}>
                Not a one-off report but an instrument: run it again in three months and check whether traceability has improved. We don't tell you why — we tell you where nobody can explain why anymore.
            </Text>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    {/* C · 页脚条（40px） */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 9 }}>
            <svg width={22} height={22} viewBox='0 0 22 22'>
                <rect x='0' y='0' width='22' height='5' fill='#232C38' />
                <rect x='0' y='5' width='22' height='6' fill='#E3A33E' />
                <rect x='0' y='11' width='22' height='5' fill='#232C38' />
                <rect x='0' y='16' width='22' height='6' fill='#1D242E' />
            </svg>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8892A0' }}>
                代码考古学 / Code Archaeology · github.com/ody-cai
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8892A0' }}>
            05 / 05
        </Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
